Narusya Voice — design shared, voice reserved.

The design documents in this repository are published for transparency,
review, and collaboration. The voice they describe — its genome,
parameters, and any audio rendered from them — belongs to Narusya.
No license is granted to clone, sample, replicate, train on, or
impersonate this voice, in whole or in part, by any method.
Reviews and commentary are welcome; implementations of this design
for any voice other than Narusya's are not.

This is not legal advice. If formalities ever matter, that is a
separate pass.